n$$\n\nAs a result, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{T}\\,Ax & =(Py)^{T}\\,A\\,(Py) \\\\  & =({y}^{T}{P}^{T})\\,A\\,(Py) \\\\  & ={y}^{T}({P}^{T}\\,AP)\\,y,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich means that the matrix of our form in the new basis is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}^{T}\\,AP & ={[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]}^{T}[\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 9 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}19 & 9 \\\\ 9 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066712/state.json" "file_sha256" "1a58bdf4310a132c712eaafc313f29c50f97c6ca5c7e4934f0f05f948cf5f825"} {"question" "q-94189" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066712/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "cd4afffd6d08f8c6a1c33a4fcbb5d3b4ed311a04ddb22e906a1ce299eba2fb26"} {"question" "q-94189" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066712/state.json" "file_sha256" "1a58bdf4310a132c712eaafc313f29c50f97c6ca5c7e4934f0f05f948cf5f825"} {"question" "q-94189" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}10 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}11 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}19 & 9 \\\\ 9 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}20 & 8 \\\\ 8 & -2\\end{align